  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Electrificacin Rural III</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rural Electrification Program III</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective of the program is to contribute to the reduction of poverty in Bolivia through the universalization of the electrical energy service, as the central axis of a fair and inclusive energy transition. The specific objectives are: (i) increase access to basic electricity service in rural areas; (ii) promote the productive uses of electrical energy in rural areas with a gender focus and (iii) strengthen institutional capacity for rural electrification investment planning.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">el objetivo general del programa es contribuir a la reduccin de la pobreza en Bolivia mediante la universalizacin del servicio de energa elctrica, como eje central de una transicin energtica justa e inclusiva. Los objetivos especficos son: (i) incrementar el acceso al servicio bsico de energa elctrica en reas rurales; (ii) promover los usos productivo de la energa elctrica en reas rurales con un enfoque de gnero y (iii) fortalecer la capacidad institucional para la planificacin de inversiones de electrificacin rural.</narrative>
  </description>
